{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkgenericdocumentfieldvalidationstatus"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkgenericdocumentfieldvalidationstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"text":"(SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optical character recognition (OCR) invariably introduces errors in the recognized text.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"There are numerous ways to verify that what has been recognized is, in fact, what was"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"written in the document."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The best way to validate the value of a field is for it to have a known format or validation","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"logic. For example, an IBAN number has a known format and two check digits that make it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"very unlikely that a value with OCR errors will pass validation. Fields with known","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"validation rules will have a validation status of either VALID or INVALID."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fields whose value can be inferred from other fields, or from domain knowledge (for example,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the field may have the same value in every instance of this type of document), will have the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"status INFERRED. Inferring the value of a field is a strong validation method, provided that"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there are no unexpected changes to the document format.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fields that do not have validation rules and cannot be inferred can still be validated by checking whether the same"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value is recognized from multiple attempts, e.g. across multiple frames of a camera stream.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the same value is recognized in multiple frames, the value is considered CONFIRMED, otherwise"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"it will have the status NONE. This is the least strict validation method, as it does not protect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from systemic OCR errors, but in practice it still provides good results for most fields."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus"}],"externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus","roleHeading":"Class","title":"SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKGenericDocumentFieldValidationStatus"}],"symbolKind":"class"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Field validation status."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/objc(cs)NSObject"]